    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Screening exam:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " when anyone comes to a hospital's emergency department asking for examination or treatment, the hospital must give an appropriate medical screening exam, within the department's capability, to determine whether an emergency medical condition exists."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Stabilize or transfer:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " if an emergency medical condition is found, the hospital must stabilize it or transfer the patient under the law's transfer rules."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Labor is an emergency:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " for a pregnant woman having contractions, it is an emergency medical condition when there is not enough time for a safe transfer before delivery, or when transfer may threaten her or the fetus."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "No delay for payment:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " the screening exam and treatment may not be delayed to ask about the patient's insurance or how she will pay."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
